# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  ConsultBae AI Automation Platform — Environment Config
#  Copy this file to .env and fill in ONE provider key.
#  The app works fully without any key (built-in rule-based fallback).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── OPTION 1: Groq (FREE — recommended) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Get your FREE key at: https://console.groq.com → API Keys → Create Key
# No credit card. No rate-limit pain. LLaMA 3.3 70B runs at ~750 tokens/sec.
#
GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-key-here
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile   # default, best quality
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.1-8b-instant      # faster, slightly less accurate

# ── OPTION 2: OpenAI (paid, ~$5 minimum) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Get your key at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ── OPTION 3: No key (default) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave everything commented out. The app uses the built-in rule-based
# classifier — equivalent results, zero cost, zero dependencies.
